  "description": "As an ordinary office worker, Min Sarin, a woman married to a college classmate who is also an ordinary office worker, is the protagonist, and it shows realistically what kind of hardships an ordinary daughter-in-law goes through in an ordinary in-laws' house.\n\n***Note:** It was serialized on Facebook and Instagram in 2017.  \nSince then, the revised version was uploaded simultaneously on KakaoPage and Kakao Webtoon on November 18, 2020, with all 33 episodes.*\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%A9%B0%EB%8A%90%EB%9D%BC%EA%B8%B0/2714), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/home?seriesId=56001072)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/70556)",
